WEBVTT

00:01:58.660 --> 00:02:03.820
How could this be?
They were so healthy until yesterday.

00:02:03.930 --> 00:02:07.490
Dammit! Damn those demons
in the Forbidden Land!

00:02:09.800 --> 00:02:12.900
This is no time for
us to be grieving!

00:02:12.970 --> 00:02:15.410
If we don't find two warriors
to replace them at once, then!

00:02:16.680 --> 00:02:19.670
But where in this
isolated place will we find...

00:02:19.750 --> 00:02:22.770
...two Warriors ofJustice
to stand in for them?!

00:02:27.950 --> 00:02:29.940
Emergency alert!
Emergency alert!

00:02:30.020 --> 00:02:32.720
Intruders detected within
defense identification zone!

00:02:35.560 --> 00:02:36.490
Let's go!

00:02:43.700 --> 00:02:47.000
Into the evil darkness which
threatens the world...

00:02:47.070 --> 00:02:50.840
...I shine my light ofJustice!
I am the Swordsman ofJustice!

00:02:53.580 --> 00:02:54.340
Who am I again?

00:02:54.710 --> 00:02:58.010
Oh, for crying out loud!
You forgot your own name?!

00:02:58.580 --> 00:03:02.150
Oh, I remember!
I am Gourry Gabriev!

00:03:04.920 --> 00:03:08.420
Um, I really don't think
this is gonna work. I hate this!

00:03:08.490 --> 00:03:10.550
What are you doing
on your back like that?!

00:03:10.630 --> 00:03:12.790
You have no business
being an Ally ofJustice!

00:03:13.170 --> 00:03:15.260
C'mon! C'mon! C'mon! C'mon!
Try it again!

00:03:16.140 --> 00:03:19.730
Let's stop, okay?
It's starting to thunder out here.

00:03:20.110 --> 00:03:21.630
What are you saying?!

00:03:21.710 --> 00:03:23.830
While we aren't with
Miss Lina and the others...

00:03:23.910 --> 00:03:27.070
...we're the only two who can
fight forJustice in the world!

00:03:27.150 --> 00:03:29.210
And servants ofJustice,
before all else...

00:03:30.020 --> 00:03:34.180
...must master the art of
making a cool entrance!

00:03:35.190 --> 00:03:37.520
You're great... I'm impressed!

00:03:37.960 --> 00:03:39.420
Now! Let's practice!

00:03:39.730 --> 00:03:43.460
Huh? Darn it...
Uh... Heaven, uh...

00:03:43.530 --> 00:03:44.590
Heaven calls me!

00:03:44.660 --> 00:03:48.390
Um, heaven and earth and everyone
calls me and I call, too, so...

00:03:48.470 --> 00:03:49.960
Say it louder!

00:03:50.040 --> 00:03:52.230
I don't hate those
who hate crime!

00:03:52.300 --> 00:03:54.070
With more feeling!

00:03:54.140 --> 00:03:57.070
I am the Swordsman ofJustice...
Well, minus the sword...

00:03:57.140 --> 00:03:58.630
More confidence!

00:03:58.710 --> 00:04:00.870
My name is Gourry Gabriev!!!

00:04:08.590 --> 00:04:12.280
Um, are you okay, Mr. Gourry?

00:04:12.860 --> 00:04:14.520
Um, Mr. Gourry?

00:04:16.260 --> 00:04:17.560
Who's there?!

00:04:17.630 --> 00:04:21.400
Special training in weather like this
in order to be Allies ofJustice.

00:04:21.470 --> 00:04:22.760
That's very commendable!

00:04:22.840 --> 00:04:25.270
However, you've
still much to learn!

00:04:25.340 --> 00:04:27.430
Where are you?!
Show yourselves!

00:04:28.470 --> 00:04:31.530
What are you looking at?
We're right over here!

00:04:34.780 --> 00:04:36.040
We appear like the wind...

00:04:36.480 --> 00:04:37.950
...to smash evil in the world!

00:04:38.420 --> 00:04:40.580
The shooting star
shining in the heavens!

00:04:51.060 --> 00:04:53.730
The Shooting Star Warriors!
PEACEMAN!

00:05:02.840 --> 00:05:05.210
Oh, my back!

00:05:06.850 --> 00:05:09.370
Who the heck are these guys?

00:05:09.950 --> 00:05:11.970
They're... They're so COOL!

00:05:12.050 --> 00:05:14.990
...is the reaction they're
probably going for.

00:05:17.520 --> 00:05:20.960
I am the cool double-
sword fencer, Gen the Wolf!

00:05:21.130 --> 00:05:23.860
I am Reika,
the Fighting Leopardess!

00:05:24.100 --> 00:05:25.650
And I...

00:05:27.230 --> 00:05:30.260
...am Bald Eagle Dai,
the leader of Peaceman.

00:05:34.310 --> 00:05:36.830
Welcome to the
Village ofJustice!

00:05:36.910 --> 00:05:42.140
Now then, won't you both join
us and fight forJustice, too?

00:06:06.570 --> 00:06:08.200
Wha... What's?

00:06:08.470 --> 00:06:11.140
This is the Village ofJustice,
where young people...

00:06:11.210 --> 00:06:13.840
...who believe in
Justice have gathered.

00:06:15.010 --> 00:06:18.380
Young people? There's nothing
but old men and women here!

00:06:18.680 --> 00:06:23.090
Long ago, we were all young and
burning to fight forJustice!

00:06:23.260 --> 00:06:27.020
However, this area's
really pretty peaceful.

00:06:27.160 --> 00:06:29.680
And while we were waiting
for villains to show up...

00:06:31.130 --> 00:06:33.760
...we all just grew into
old men and women.

00:06:34.100 --> 00:06:36.500
You J UST grew into?! Hey!

00:06:36.570 --> 00:06:38.800
There! Look!

00:06:40.540 --> 00:06:42.940
Are you okay?! Hey!

00:06:44.110 --> 00:06:47.170
Our secret base!

00:06:47.650 --> 00:06:50.140
The Institute of AbsoluteJustice!

00:06:53.290 --> 00:06:56.280
Institute of AbsoluteJustice?

00:06:58.360 --> 00:06:59.120
What's?

00:06:59.190 --> 00:07:02.790
This is our secretly-
developed defense facility.

00:07:02.860 --> 00:07:07.700
From this position, we can keep
up the battle day and night!

00:07:07.930 --> 00:07:12.500
And now...
Now demons have appeared!

00:07:12.840 --> 00:07:15.140
Here, listen to this!

00:07:15.410 --> 00:07:16.310
Oh, dear!

00:07:16.510 --> 00:07:18.100
M- Mr. Dai!

00:07:32.320 --> 00:07:36.280
Several days ago, in the peaceful
paradise beyond the mountains...

00:07:36.360 --> 00:07:40.960
...we picked up the demons'
voices in the Forbidden Land.

00:07:41.630 --> 00:07:43.690
They're now moving this way!

00:07:43.970 --> 00:07:45.770
Forbidden Land... Demons?!

00:07:45.840 --> 00:07:50.070
Knowing that, we of Peaceman
decided to face these creatures...

00:07:50.140 --> 00:07:52.130
...and you set off for
the Forbidden Land, right?!

00:07:52.380 --> 00:07:55.210
Well, before we could set out...

00:07:55.280 --> 00:07:57.910
The demons sent a
vanguard to attack you?!

00:07:57.980 --> 00:08:04.050
Yes, we suffered an attack.
And two of us were struck down.

00:08:09.130 --> 00:08:10.990
What the?

00:08:11.960 --> 00:08:18.700
Dammit! I can't
just... die like this!

00:08:19.200 --> 00:08:23.300
Those damned demons...
in the Forbidden Land!

00:08:23.710 --> 00:08:27.840
Horrible... It's like the
life's been sucked out of them.

00:08:27.910 --> 00:08:30.140
The march of
time claims victims...

00:08:30.220 --> 00:08:33.210
...even from those
who fight forJustice.

00:08:34.850 --> 00:08:37.480
You mean, when they were
struck down before setting out?

00:08:37.560 --> 00:08:40.530
Yeah, I meant they
caught a cold.

00:08:43.960 --> 00:08:45.490
Before you set out, right?

00:08:45.560 --> 00:08:48.760
Meaning the demons had
nothing to do with it?!

00:08:48.930 --> 00:08:52.060
What?!
What are you saying?!

00:08:52.140 --> 00:08:55.730
We've gotten this old
without ever leaving this place...

00:08:55.810 --> 00:08:58.800
...so you can be damned
sure it's those demons' fault!

00:09:03.220 --> 00:09:06.980
What's wrong?! Snap out of it!
Hold on! What's wrong?!

00:09:07.050 --> 00:09:08.180
Big brother...

00:09:08.250 --> 00:09:09.980
Oh, little brother...

00:09:10.060 --> 00:09:13.350
Huh? You guys are brothers?

00:09:14.060 --> 00:09:16.460
The five members
of Peaceman are one!

00:09:16.960 --> 00:09:21.490
And we need your help to
fight these awful demons!

00:09:22.670 --> 00:09:26.500
From now on, you will be
Warriors ofJustice!

00:09:36.550 --> 00:09:38.610
From this day, you are...

00:09:38.680 --> 00:09:40.310
Ryo the Young Lion!

00:09:40.390 --> 00:09:44.150
And you are Mei the Swan!

00:09:47.160 --> 00:09:52.530
Now... I can leave
this world in peace...

00:09:52.930 --> 00:09:57.930
We leave the rest...
up to you...

00:10:02.110 --> 00:10:04.410
Hey! You can't die yet!

00:10:10.720 --> 00:10:12.510
Hey, Amelia...

00:10:14.190 --> 00:10:15.880
Let's do it, Mr. Gourry.

00:10:17.490 --> 00:10:20.620
With five warriors who
live as one as its basis...

00:10:20.990 --> 00:10:23.930
...they built a secret village
to fight forJustice.

00:10:24.000 --> 00:10:29.020
Can we really let all of their
hard work be for nothing?!

00:10:29.370 --> 00:10:34.030
Are you serious? B-B-But what
about looking for Lina?

00:10:34.110 --> 00:10:38.440
I, Amelia Wil Tesla Seyruun,
who lives forJustice!

00:10:38.510 --> 00:10:40.030
The blood inside of me...

00:10:40.550 --> 00:10:44.540
Yes! The blood within me
that burns forJustice...

00:10:44.620 --> 00:10:48.520
It will not allow evil to exist!
It calls me to smash evil apart!

00:10:52.120 --> 00:10:53.520
Whoa! Now what?!

00:11:00.600 --> 00:11:01.660
Sound off!

00:11:01.800 --> 00:11:02.660
One!

00:11:02.770 --> 00:11:03.560
Two!

00:11:03.700 --> 00:11:04.570
Three!

00:11:04.840 --> 00:11:05.560
Four!

00:11:05.670 --> 00:11:06.900
Uh, um, f- five?

00:11:07.140 --> 00:11:09.070
The shooting star
shining in the heavens!

00:11:09.410 --> 00:11:11.030
The Shooting Star Warriors!

00:11:11.110 --> 00:11:12.870
PEACEMAN!

00:11:13.080 --> 00:11:14.270
Got it!

00:11:15.680 --> 00:11:18.670
We're just getting further and
further from the main plot, aren't we?

00:11:42.870 --> 00:11:46.440
Why'd they have to
choose the hardest route?

00:12:00.030 --> 00:12:01.990
Wh-Wh-What's up?

00:12:04.100 --> 00:12:05.760
We're lost.

00:12:06.300 --> 00:12:10.260
Curse those demons,
luring us into a labyrinth...

00:12:10.340 --> 00:12:13.100
...to keep us from
the Forbidden Land!

00:12:13.470 --> 00:12:15.270
How... How...

00:12:15.510 --> 00:12:18.030
How low will those fiends sink?!

00:12:18.380 --> 00:12:19.900
Oh, really?

00:12:19.980 --> 00:12:23.000
Looked to me like you just
intentionally got us lost.

00:12:23.720 --> 00:12:25.050
And I followed them?!

00:12:28.190 --> 00:12:29.880
What's the big idea?!

00:12:29.960 --> 00:12:31.390
I misjudged you, Ryo!

00:12:31.760 --> 00:12:34.020
To raise a fuss
over such a thing...

00:12:34.090 --> 00:12:36.650
Are you really that
much of an amateur?!

00:12:36.730 --> 00:12:42.260
It would shame the former Ryo
to the depths of his soul!

00:12:42.370 --> 00:12:43.800
That's right, Mr. Gourry!

00:12:44.100 --> 00:12:47.090
Having the courage to
face any adversity!

00:12:47.170 --> 00:12:49.330
That is the true
essence ofJustice!

00:12:51.580 --> 00:12:53.440
Well said, Mei!

00:12:53.510 --> 00:12:56.410
I'm moved!
Thank you! Thank you!

00:12:56.820 --> 00:12:59.280
Come forth, evil which
threatens the world!

00:12:59.380 --> 00:13:01.680
In the name ofJustice, Amel...

00:13:01.750 --> 00:13:04.590
I mean, Mei shall
not let you stand!

00:13:04.690 --> 00:13:06.250
That deserves a
special effect!

00:13:06.590 --> 00:13:07.350
Yes, sir!

00:13:09.860 --> 00:13:15.730
Oh... We're so happy!

00:13:17.600 --> 00:13:18.830
Are you serious?

00:13:18.900 --> 00:13:21.800
What's wrong with it?
It made them happy, right?

00:13:24.710 --> 00:13:27.140
They've come!
A servant of the demons!

00:13:27.210 --> 00:13:27.940
The enemy?

00:13:37.990 --> 00:13:42.950
Damn you! Stop hiding yourself
and face us honorably!

00:13:51.370 --> 00:13:53.930
Daddy! DADDY!!!

00:13:54.110 --> 00:13:55.200
Daddy?!

00:13:55.270 --> 00:13:56.430
Is she mad?!

00:13:56.780 --> 00:13:59.370
Daddy! What are
you doing here?!

00:13:59.810 --> 00:14:02.800
Oh, my mistake. It's a dwarf
who looks a lot like my dad.

00:14:02.980 --> 00:14:05.210
Look out! DASH!!!

00:14:17.460 --> 00:14:18.120
It ran.

00:14:18.600 --> 00:14:19.390
You okay?

00:14:19.460 --> 00:14:20.430
Y- Yeah...

00:14:20.500 --> 00:14:22.970
I told you to be careful!

00:14:23.030 --> 00:14:25.230
The Forest of the Dwarves
is the first obstacle...

00:14:25.300 --> 00:14:26.500
...on the way to
the Forbidden Land!

00:14:26.570 --> 00:14:28.540
Why didn't you TELL us?!

00:14:29.510 --> 00:14:31.770
Snap out of it, Mei!

00:14:32.240 --> 00:14:36.840
Taking advantage of weaknesses
of the heart to control you...

00:14:36.920 --> 00:14:38.440
Typical of the demons' methods!

00:14:38.680 --> 00:14:41.380
Oh, no! That was just an
honest mistake before.

00:14:41.450 --> 00:14:45.890
Um, I mean... That was a
devious trap by the demons!

00:14:45.960 --> 00:14:48.390
I, um, can't forgive that!

00:14:59.540 --> 00:15:01.130
I'll handle this!

00:15:01.210 --> 00:15:04.940
Now taste the bite of my
Vacuum Slash Special!

00:15:18.820 --> 00:15:20.350
Wha? Did he just slice him?

00:15:20.430 --> 00:15:23.990
In... Incredible, Dai!
Let me help!

00:15:24.200 --> 00:15:26.390
Ribbon Atta-a-a-ack!

00:15:28.400 --> 00:15:30.630
R- Reika!

00:15:33.740 --> 00:15:34.400
Gen...

00:15:35.410 --> 00:15:36.140
Reika...

00:15:38.940 --> 00:15:41.910
Hang on! Hang on, Reika!

00:15:43.280 --> 00:15:46.050
Forgive me... I...

00:15:46.220 --> 00:15:48.340
I wanted to fight
on to the very end...

00:15:48.420 --> 00:15:53.650
What are you saying? OurJustice
isn't this easily discouraged!

00:15:53.730 --> 00:15:56.060
Isn't that right, Reika?

00:15:56.230 --> 00:15:59.960
F- Farewell, Gen...

00:16:00.060 --> 00:16:05.730
R- Reika... No... REl KA!!!

00:16:07.310 --> 00:16:11.000
And another of us falls...

00:16:11.080 --> 00:16:15.480
Reika, your life has
not been lived in vain!

00:16:16.310 --> 00:16:20.410
This is no time to grieve!
You must go on without us!

00:16:20.490 --> 00:16:22.650
Make it out of here
to the ultimate obstacle:

00:16:22.720 --> 00:16:24.780
The Valley of the Baby Dragon!

00:16:24.860 --> 00:16:26.950
Another thing he
forgot to tell us...

00:16:27.090 --> 00:16:32.050
You must get to the demons
at once! Now hurry!

00:16:32.860 --> 00:16:33.730
Move it!

00:16:34.300 --> 00:16:37.700
Right! Let's go, Mr. Gourry!

00:16:37.770 --> 00:16:39.200
Huh? Right...

00:16:40.000 --> 00:16:41.270
Be careful!

00:16:43.840 --> 00:16:47.740
Listen, are you really taking
those old guys seriously?

00:16:47.810 --> 00:16:50.410
It doesn't matter
either way, does it?

00:16:52.780 --> 00:16:53.770
Wh- What the...

00:17:00.990 --> 00:17:03.650
Um, we don't have
anything against you.

00:17:03.730 --> 00:17:05.390
Could you get out
of our way, please?

00:17:12.000 --> 00:17:14.940
C'mon! Shoot the thing already!

00:17:15.010 --> 00:17:17.130
B- But, it's so...

00:17:19.010 --> 00:17:20.000
Amelia!

00:17:20.080 --> 00:17:21.770
But, it's!

00:17:27.020 --> 00:17:29.990
How naive to be
fooled by appearances!

00:17:30.460 --> 00:17:33.420
Now, see the true
power ofJustice!

00:17:34.560 --> 00:17:36.220
PEACEMAN!

00:17:36.860 --> 00:17:37.590
Gramps?!

00:17:40.570 --> 00:17:41.550
Mr. Dai, don't!

00:17:42.100 --> 00:17:46.040
Sometimes extreme measures must
be taken in the fight forJustice!

00:17:46.370 --> 00:17:48.430
No! YOU'RE the ones...

00:17:54.950 --> 00:17:58.140
...who are in danger,
I was trying to say...

00:18:02.220 --> 00:18:02.950
What's that?

00:18:03.350 --> 00:18:05.820
No choice now.
BURST RONDO!

00:18:11.300 --> 00:18:13.320
Oops. Opposite effect.

00:18:15.700 --> 00:18:16.960
Grab on, Gramps!

00:18:18.740 --> 00:18:20.400
Mr. Gourry! RAYWI NG!

00:18:20.910 --> 00:18:22.400
DO SOMETHI NG!

00:18:22.470 --> 00:18:24.770
I can't, Gramps! Hang on!

00:18:34.490 --> 00:18:36.890
Right! Here! Over here!

00:18:37.220 --> 00:18:40.050
There we go. Feeling
frisky today, aren't you?

00:18:40.120 --> 00:18:41.890
Huh?
What're you eating there?

00:18:42.360 --> 00:18:44.350
Why, you...
Lemme go! Let me GO!

00:18:44.700 --> 00:18:49.790
Oh, my. It's the chief of the
Village ofJustice, isn't it?

00:18:49.870 --> 00:18:52.130
Were you playing
"Allies ofJustice"...

00:18:52.200 --> 00:18:54.070
...and attacking those
innocent dwarves again?

00:18:54.640 --> 00:18:57.010
Huh? Innocent dwarves?

00:18:57.080 --> 00:18:59.130
PLAYI NG Allies ofJustice?

00:18:59.210 --> 00:19:00.580
But, what about this dragon?

00:19:00.810 --> 00:19:03.710
That's Marilyn, my pet.

00:19:03.780 --> 00:19:06.750
And the dwarves in the
forest are nice people.

00:19:06.820 --> 00:19:09.150
They hang out with those
old codgers for fun.

00:19:09.550 --> 00:19:11.920
So, this "Forbidden Land"
paradise is?

00:19:11.990 --> 00:19:14.120
That's right! It's here!

00:19:14.190 --> 00:19:17.090
But it's a fact that demons
have entered this place!

00:19:17.160 --> 00:19:19.630
The time's come to show
you the power ofJustice!

00:19:19.700 --> 00:19:22.500
But there's nothing
weird going on around here.

00:19:23.030 --> 00:19:25.900
That can't be true!
Listen carefully!

00:19:25.970 --> 00:19:30.100
I know you'll be able to
hear the demons' voices!

00:19:30.340 --> 00:19:31.070
I hear it!

00:19:35.010 --> 00:19:36.450
I'm sure I hear it!

00:19:48.560 --> 00:19:49.720
Mr. Gourry!

00:19:54.400 --> 00:19:56.230
Hey, they really did come!

00:19:56.300 --> 00:19:58.890
Guess Filia's predictions
really were right after all.

00:19:58.970 --> 00:19:59.730
Told you.

00:19:59.800 --> 00:20:04.300
Yoo-hoo! Gourry! Amelia!
You finally joined us!

00:20:04.480 --> 00:20:05.130
Lina!

00:20:05.210 --> 00:20:06.140
Miss Lina!

00:20:06.210 --> 00:20:09.010
Which means the
demon was Miss Lina.

00:20:09.080 --> 00:20:10.140
Exactly!

00:20:10.210 --> 00:20:12.210
Don't shrink back,
Warriors ofJustice!

00:20:12.280 --> 00:20:15.150
They are the demons who have
come to the Forbidden Land!

00:20:15.690 --> 00:20:16.680
Demons?

00:20:16.750 --> 00:20:18.150
Who are these old coots?!

00:20:18.590 --> 00:20:21.580
Um, Miss Lina, I can explain.

00:20:21.660 --> 00:20:24.990
You see! They're ignoring the
"keep off the grass" rule!

00:20:25.060 --> 00:20:26.760
We can't let these
villains get away!

00:20:26.830 --> 00:20:28.420
The grass? Villains?

00:20:28.830 --> 00:20:30.390
Now go on and attack!

00:20:30.470 --> 00:20:34.560
Let the Hammer ofJustice
fall upon these demons!

00:20:34.640 --> 00:20:36.330
Um, well... You see...

00:20:36.410 --> 00:20:39.770
Look, Gramps, you'd better
cut that talk out right now!

00:20:39.840 --> 00:20:42.900
Did you tell them that
we're demons of some sort?!

00:20:43.380 --> 00:20:46.250
No, they're just...
You know...

00:20:49.790 --> 00:20:50.580
Oh. my goodness!

